153	   * swatch-group/index.jsx onKeyDown (ArrowUp/ArrowLeft = backward, ArrowDown/ArrowRight =
154	   * forward, wrapping at the ends via modulus). Deliberately moves DOM focus only, via
155	   * `.focus()` on the sibling node, rather than touching `isFocusable`/selection state the way
156	   * base's own version does: there is no onVariationChange-equivalent prop here for an arrow
157	   * press to call (product-detail, Step 4, passes none yet), so there is nothing to trigger
158	   * beyond moving which element has focus. Activation stays the anchor's native Enter key,
159	   * inherited for free from the atom's ColourSwatchLink. Space does not activate an anchor
160	   * element — a native browser/HTML behaviour, not a bug, and an inherited parity gap versus a
